,"unlimited"],[5336,"unlimited"],[4500,"Unlimited locked memory is an option for a dedicated service with a planned memory budget. A finite limit is also valid if it covers the runtime's locked-memory requirements. Neither setting creates RAM or overrides a container's memory ceiling."],[4258,"unset"],[5590,"unset"],[2598,"Unset"],[3906,"unset (\"128 KiB\")"],[3909,"unset (\"128 KiB\")"],[3918,"unset (\"16 MiB\")"],[3915,"unset (\"64 MiB\")"],[3912,"unset (unlimited)"],[2959,"Until the release packages are published, use the SDK from the same release candidate as the server. Replace the iggy dependency in Cargo.toml with:"],[5647,"unused"],[2497,"unwrap_envelope"],[2241,"unwrap_envelope - promote a nested field of a JSON envelope to the top-level payload."],[3996,"Up to two previous server keys retained during rotation. Secret."],[4849,"Update"],[885,"Update permissions. Code: 36."],[1021,"Update requests are patches: keys absent from the block are left alone, never reset. A client built before a key existed cannot erase it."],[142,"Update stream name"],[154,"Update topic settings"],[198,"Update user details"],[202,"Update user permissions"],[2495,"update_fields"],[2237,"update_fields - update existing fields with static or computed values such as timestamp_millis or uuid_v7."],[201,"update_permissions"],[141,"update_stream"],[153,"update_topic"],[197,"update_user"],[1233,"UpdatePermissions"],[1248,"UpdateResource"],[897,"UpdateResource is code 16, operation 150:"],[1776,"Updates preserve omitted fields. Compression and storage options remain fixed at creation. topic get displays partition details and explicit and derived options. See Topic options."],[4955,"Updates use UpdateResource with a set/reset patch. SDKs retain resource-specific update methods, but these methods send the shared command. Only name, message_expiry and max_topic_size can change on a topic."],[4972,"Upgrade clients and tools"],[3266,"Upgrade every reader of the topic to a compatible 0.10 client